theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 25
text = "Congratulations. You survived the first date, bowling, shooting, and making Bel cry like a potato.
Your reward?
Me. Forever. Sorry.

In all seriousness, I made this because four years with you has given me more memories than I could ever cram into one little game. Some are huge, some are completely ridiculous, and some probably wouldn't mean anything to anyone except us. They're my favorite memories anyway.

I didn't get to build every level I wanted to, but that's okay. We haven't lived all of them yet either.
I love you, I love our weird little life, and I can't wait to see what we unlock next."
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

